{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:packages/ui/src/components/OmDialog.vue",
    "title": "证据路径模态对话框",
    "summary": "基于原生 dialog 管理模态打开、焦点归还、返回与关闭事件，并支持证据层级、操作区和可选侧栏。",
    "category": "implementation",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "lifecycle",
        "title": "打开、关闭与焦点",
        "body": "组件监听 open 属性：打开前等待 DOM 更新，保存当前活动元素并调用 showModal；关闭时调用原生 close，再把焦点还给仍连接在文档中的原元素。卸载前也会关闭 dialog。[[c1]] 原生 cancel 被阻止并转换为 back，因此 Esc 表示退一层而非直接关闭全部；点击遮罩或右上关闭按钮则发出 close。[[c2]] 组件自身不修改 open，状态所有权留给父组件。"
      },
      {
        "key": "composition",
        "title": "证据阅读布局",
        "body": "标题区可按 depth 显示“证据路径”层级，主体包含默认滚动插槽、可选 aside 和 actions 页脚；sideOpen 同时决定侧栏可见性与宽版样式。[[c3]] OmButton 和 OmIcon 被直接用于关闭按钮，表明该组件依赖基础 UI 原语来保持交互外观一致。桌面端侧栏固定 330px，移动端改为纵向并给正文和侧栏分别设置视口高度约束。[[c4]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "limits",
        "title": "边界条件",
        "body": "焦点仅在由 open 变为 false 的分支中归还；若组件仍打开时直接卸载，卸载钩子只关闭 dialog，没有执行焦点恢复。[[c1]] 标题使用固定 id `om-dialog-title`，若页面同时挂载多个实例，aria-labelledby 可能指向重复标识；材料也没有显示组件内部的焦点陷阱测试或多层实例测试。sideOpen 为假时 aside 仍通过 v-if 创建、再由 v-show 隐藏，插槽内容仍可能保留状态与成本。[[c3]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "对话框生命周期与焦点恢复",
        "reason": "支持模态打开、受控关闭、焦点归还及卸载行为的说明。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/ui/src/components/OmDialog.vue",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 28
        },
        "quote": "<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { ref, watch, nextTick, onBeforeUnmount } from \"vue\";\nimport OmButton from \"./OmButton.vue\";\nimport OmIcon from \"./OmIcon.vue\";\nconst props = defineProps<{\n  open: boolean;\n  title: string;\n  depth?: number;\n  sideOpen?: boolean;\n}>();\nconst emit = defineEmits<{ close: []; back: [] }>();"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "返回与关闭事件",
        "reason": "说明 Esc、遮罩点击和关闭按钮分别映射到 back 或 close。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/ui/src/components/OmDialog.vue",
          "startLine": 30,
          "endLine": 52
        },
        "quote": "<template>\n  <dialog\n    ref=\"dialog\"\n    class=\"om-dialog\"\n    :class=\"{ wide: sideOpen }\"\n    aria-labelledby=\"om-dialog-title\"\n    @cancel.prevent=\"emit('back')\"\n    @click=\"\n      (e) => {\n        if (e.target === dialog) emit('close');\n      }\n    \"\n  >\n    <div class=\"dialog-inner\">\n      <header>\n        <div>\n "
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "插槽与侧栏结构",
        "reason": "支持层级标题、正文、侧栏、操作区和 sideOpen 渲染方式的说明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/ui/src/components/OmDialog.vue",
          "startLine": 43,
          "endLine": 61
        },
        "quote": "    <div class=\"dialog-inner\">\n      <header>\n        <div>\n          <small v-if=\"depth\">证据路径 · 第 {{ depth }} 层</small>\n          <h2 id=\"om-dialog-title\">{{ title }}</h2>\n        </div>\n        <OmButton variant=\"ghost\" aria-label=\"关闭全部\" @click=\"emit('close')\"\n          ><OmIcon name=\"close\"\n        /></OmButton>\n   "
      },
      {
        "key": "c4",
        "label": "响应式双栏布局",
        "reason": "说明宽版对话框、固定侧栏及移动端纵向布局的实现。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/ui/src/components/OmDialog.vue",
          "startLine": 128,
          "endLine": 164
        },
        "quote": ".om-dialog.wide {\n  width: min(1160px, calc(100vw - 64px));\n}\n.dialog-body {\n  display: flex;\n  flex: 1;\n  min-height: 0;\n}\n.dialog-body > .dialog-scroll {\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n.dialog-body > aside {\n  width: 330px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  border-left: 1px solid var(--om-line);\n  overflow: auto;\n}\n@media (max-width: 700px) {\n"
      }
